ve group\"><a class=\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light bg-[#f0fdf4] dark:bg-brand-red-dark/30\" href=\"/programmes\">Programmes</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-brand-red dark:hover:text-brand-red-light hover:bg-[#f0fdf4] dark:hover:bg-brand-red-dark/20\" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-brand-red dark:hover:text-brand-red-light hover:bg-[#f0fdf4] dark:hover:bg-brand-red-dark/20\" href=\"/events\">News &amp; Events</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-brand-red dark:hover:text-brand-red-light hover:bg-[#f0fdf4] dark:hover:bg-brand-red-dark/20\" href=\"/mosque\">Mosque</a></div><div class=\"relative group\"><a class=\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-brand-red dark:hover:text-brand-red-light hover:bg-[#f0fdf4] dark:hover:bg-brand-red-dark/20\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></nav><div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-3\"><button aria-label=\"Toggle theme\" class=\"p-2 rounded-lg text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:text-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-brand-red dark:hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\" href=\"/login\">Sign in</a><a class=\"px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-br from-[#b8860b] to-[#d4a017] rounded-full shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all font-[Outfit]\" href=\"/donate\">Donate</a><a class=\"px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-red to-brand-red-dark rounded-full shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all font-[Outfit]\" href=\"/register\">Join ALIF</a></div><div class=\"flex lg:hidden items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-lg text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"p-2 rounded-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-white/8 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1117]\"><section class=\"py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0a3d26] via-[#0f5132] to-[#1e2a35] text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><span class=\"text-[#d4a017] text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest\">Our Activities</span><h1 class=\"mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold font-[Outfit] leading-tight\">ALIF Programmes</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-white/80 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Discover the diverse range of educational, spiritual, and humanitarian initiatives we undertake to serve the Ummah.</p></div></section><section class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mic w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19v3\"></path><path d=\"M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2\"></path><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Da&#x27;wah</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Da&#x27;wah Enlightenment</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Spreading the correct understanding of Islam, reviving the Sunnah, and guiding people towards Tawheed through regular continuous lectures and talks.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=dawah-enlightenment\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Outreach</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Rural Da&#x27;wah</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Village outreach programs aimed at teaching Islam, distributing relief materials, and supporting neglected remote communities.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=rural-dawah\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-stethoscope w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1\"></path><path d=\"M8 15a6 6 0 0 0 12 0v-3\"></path><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Welfare</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Medical Outreach</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Free medical services, health awareness campaigns, and wellness programs for underprivileged populations.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=medical-outreach\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Education</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Madrasah (Islamic Education)</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Structured Islamic education focusing on Arabic language, Aqeedah, Fiqh, Hadith, and Seerah for all ages.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=madrasah\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Seasonal</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Ramadan Programmes</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Comprehensive Ramadan activities including Tafseer, community Iftar gatherings, Qiyam-ul-Layl, and I&#x27;tikaf.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=ramadan-programmes\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hand-heart w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 14h2a2 2 0 0 0 0-4h-3c-.6 0-1.1.2-1.4.6L3 16\"></path><path d=\"m14.45 13.39 5.05-4.694C20.196 8 21 6.85 21 5.75a2.75 2.75 0 0 0-4.797-1.837.276.276 0 0 1-.406 0A2.75 2.75 0 0 0 11 5.75c0 1.2.802 2.248 1.5 2.946L16 11.95\"></path><path d=\"m2 15 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m7 20 1.6-1.4c.3-.4.8-.6 1.4-.6h4c1.1 0 2.1-.4 2.8-1.2l4.6-4.4a1 1 0 0 0-2.75-2.91\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Welfare</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Welfare Support</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Financial, material, and emotional support for orphans, widows, and vulnerable members of the community.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=welfare\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H19a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v18a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H6.5a1 1 0 0 1 0-5H20\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Women</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Sisters&#x27; Circle</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Dedicated educational and spiritual programs specifically designed to address the needs of Muslim women and sisters.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=sisters-circle\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Youth</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Youth Development &amp; Tutorial Classes</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Academic support, tutorial classes, and mentorship for students in both secular and Islamic studies.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=youth-development\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Education</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Qur&#x27;an &amp; Quiz Competitions</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Annual quiz and Qur&#x27;an memorization competitions to encourage Hifdh and diligent study among the youth.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=quran-competition\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H19a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v18a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H6.5a1 1 0 0 1 0-5H20\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Education</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Halqoh (Study Circles)</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Intensive study circles designed for deep and focused learning of classical Islamic texts with qualified scholars.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=halqoh\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Da&#x27;wah</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Public Lectures</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Open townhall lectures and seminars featuring esteemed scholars to educate the general public on vital Islamic topics.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=public-lectures\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-xl transition-all group\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red/5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target w-16 h-16 text-brand-red opacity-50 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-white/90 dark:bg-black/70 backdrop-blur text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-full\">Youth</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-red dark:group-hover:text-brand-red-light transition-colors\">Secondary School Da&#x27;wah</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Outreach programs designed specifically for secondary school students to build early foundations and moral character.</p><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-brand-red dark:text-brand-red-light flex items-center gap-1 hover:gap-2 transition-all\" href=\"/donate?cause=sec-sch-dawah\">Support this programme <span>→</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-[#faf6ef] dark:bg-[#161b22] border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-[Outfit] mb-4\">Want to participate?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8\">Our programmes are open to all Muslims. Register to become a member and start attending our study circles, or volunteer for our outreach programs.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\"><a class=\"px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-red to-brand-red-dark text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:shadow-lg transition-all font-[Outfit]\" href=\"/register\">Become a Member</a><a class=\"px-8 py-3.5 border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 font-medium rounded-full hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-white/5 transition-all\" href=\"/gallery\">View Gallery</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[#0a3d26] text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-16 pb-12\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-5\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl font-[Outfit]\">ا</span></div><div><div class=\"text-base font-bold text-white font-[Outfit]\">Al-Ibaanah</div><div class=\"text-[10px] text-white/50 tracking-widest uppercase\">Islamic Foundation</div></div></a><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Propagating authentic Islam upon the Qur&#x27;an and Sunnah, upon the understanding of the Salaf.</p><div class=\"space-y-2.5 text-sm text-white/60\"><a href=\"mailto:info@alif.ng\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-[#d4a017] transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg> info@alif.ng</a><a href=\"tel:+2348000000000\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-[#d4a017] transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1